Subject: [PATCH] abyss: for a single token, ABYSS_HC_FUSE=1 computes the
 hyper-connection gates and combs of DeepSeek V4 in the kernels next to them
 (the split-K reduce of the mixes also writes the gate and the comb built
 right after them, and a gate whose values the collapse of the residual copies
 takes runs with the collapse and the rms_norm after it as one kernel), and
 ABYSS_GATHER_FUSE=1 writes the keys and the mask of the attention with the
 top-k compressed rows (0008) in one kernel instead of get_rows, cast and
 concat for each, unless an output overlaps a tensor the kernel reads; both
 give the same results; test-backend-ops gains DSV4_GATHER_KV

